+Boca+Raton+FL+33431","access_notes":"Restricted to FAU students with an Owl Card; equipment is subject to availability and arena house rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fau-esports-table-tennis","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Table Tennis at the Florida Atlantic Esports Arena","title":"Trade Table-Tennis Rallies","subtitle":"Florida Atlantic Esports Arena and Gaming Center · Student Union","notes":"Ask a classmate to join a quick table-tennis match, and have your Owl Card ready for the free student equipment checkout.","short_summary":"Turn a study break into a no-cost table-tennis match at the campus gaming center.","evidence_claim":"Florida Atlantic lists ping pong among the arena’s activities and says every arena feature and equipment checkout is free for FAU students with an Owl Card.","source_url":"https://www.fau.edu/studentunion/esports/","source_title":"eSports Arena and Gaming Center | Florida Atlantic University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Florida+Atlantic+University+Student+Union+777+Glades+Road+Boca+Raton+FL+33431","access_notes":"FAU students must show an Owl Card. Check availability on arrival and follow the arena’s posted equipment rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fau-esports-board-games","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Board Games at the Florida Atlantic Esports Arena","title":"Open a Board Game","subtitle":"Florida Atlantic Esports Arena and Gaming Center · Student Union","notes":"Gather a small group at the arena’s game tables, show your Owl Card, and select an available board game without buying anything.","short_summary":"Share a screen-free game session in the Student Union’s dedicated gaming space.","evidence_claim":"The arena’s official page identifies board-game tables and states that all arena feature